			"end": 275,
			"styles": "\n\t/* A keyframe selector glued to a no-break space (U+00A0) is not the `from`/`to`\n\t   keyword (the space is part of the name), so it is kept verbatim: not lowercased,\n\t   the space intact */\n\t@keyframes slide {\n\t\tFROM  {\n\t\t\tleft: 0;\n\t\t}\n\t\tto  {\n\t\t\tleft: 100%;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
